tests/ui/check/err_uncertainty_units.sky:2:13: error: cannot use a time as the uncertainty of a mass
  |
2 | m = 5.31 kg ± 20 s
  |             ^ mismatched dimensions
  |     ------- mass
  |               ---- time
  = note: the uncertainty of a value has the dimension of the value
  = help: give both sides the same unit: `5.31 ± 0.02 kg`, or `5.31 kg ± 20 g`

